#: playfield.cpp:247
msgid ""
"Your opponent is using a pre-KDE4 version of Naval Battle. Note that, "
"according to the rules enforced by old clients, ships cannot be placed "
"adjacent to one another and only one ship of each size is allowed."
msgstr ""
"Vaš protivnik koristi pre-KDE4 verziju Pomorske Bitke. Imajte na umu da, u "
"skladu s pravilima koja nameću stari klijenti, brodovi ne mogu biti "
"postavljeni jedan do drugoga i samo po jedan brod od svake veličine je "
"dozvoljen."

#: playfield.cpp:260
msgid "Enemy has shot. Shoot now!"
msgstr "Neprijatelj je pucao. Uzvrati!"

#: playfield.cpp:264
msgid "Waiting for enemy to shoot..."
msgstr "Čekam neprijatelja da zapuca..."

#: playfield.cpp:273
msgid "Ships placed. Now shoot on the enemy field!"
msgstr "Brodovi postavljeni. Sada pucajte na neprijateljevo polje"

#: playfield.cpp:276
msgid "Waiting for other player to start the game..."
msgstr "Čekam drugog igrača da započne igru..."

#: playfield.cpp:280
msgid "Waiting for other player to place his ships..."
msgstr "Čekam drugog igrača da postavi brodove..."

#: playfield.cpp:294
#, kde-format
msgid "Place your %1 ships. Use the right mouse button to rotate them."
msgstr "Postavite vaše %1 brodove. Koristite desnu tipku miša da ih rotirate."

#: playfield.cpp:300
msgid "You can't place your remaining ships."
msgstr "Ne možete postaviti vaše preostale brodove."

#: playfield.cpp:301
